<mvc:View controllerName="fico.zcosttransfer.controller.Main" displayBlock="true" 
    xmlns:mvc="sap.ui.core.mvc" 
    xmlns:core="sap.ui.core" 
    xmlns="sap.m"
	xmlns:f="sap.f" 
    xmlns:smartFilterBar="sap.ui.comp.smartfilterbar" 
	xmlns:sv="sap.ui.comp.smartvariants" >
    <f:DynamicPage headerExpanded="true">
        <f:title>
            <f:DynamicPageTitle>
                <f:heading>
                    <sv:SmartVariantManagement id="__SVM01" persistencyKey="CostTransferSVM" showShare="true" showExecuteOnSelection="true" entitySet="ZC_COST_TRANSFER"/>
                </f:heading>
            </f:DynamicPageTitle>
        </f:title>
        <f:header>
            <f:DynamicPageHeader pinnable="true">
                <f:content>
                    <FlexBox fitContainer="true">
                        <smartFilterBar:SmartFilterBar id="idSmartFilterBar" entitySet="CostTransfer" useToolbar="false" smartVariant="__SVM01" persistencyKey="CostTransferSFB" initialized="onsMrilterBarInitialized" search="onSearch">
                            <smartFilterBar:controlConfiguration>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='10' key="CompanyCode" mandatory="mandatory" filterType="single" displayBehaviour="idAndDescription" visibleInAdvancedArea="true" label="{i18n>CompanyCode}"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='20' key="FiscalYear" mandatory="mandatory" filterType="single" visibleInAdvancedArea="true" label="{i18n>FiscalYear}">
				                    <smartFilterBar:customControl>
					                    <!-- <DatePicker id="idFiscalYear" displayFormat="yyyy" /> -->
				                    </smartFilterBar:customControl>
			                    </smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='30' key="FiscalPeriod" mandatory="mandatory" filterType="single" visibleInAdvancedArea="true" label="{i18n>FiscalPeriod}">
                                    <smartFilterBar:customControl>
                                    <!-- <DatePicker id="idFiscalPeriod" displayFormat="MM" /> -->
                                    </smartFilterBar:customControl>
                                </smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration>	
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='40' key="Ledger" mandatory="mandatory" filterType="single" displayBehaviour="idAndDescription" visibleInAdvancedArea="true" label="{i18n>Ledger}"/>
                                <!-- visible -->
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="Supplier" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="GLAccount" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="SupplierName" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="GLAccountLongName" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="AmountInTransCrcy" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="TransactionCurrency" visible="false"/>

                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="AmountInCoCodeCrcy" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="CompanyCodeCurrency" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="AmountInFunctionalCrcy" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="FunctionalCurrency" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="AccountingDocument" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="Msgty" visible="false"/>
                                <smartFilterBar:ControlConfiguration index='999' key="Message" visible="false"/>
                            </smartFilterBar:controlConfiguration>
                        </smartFilterBar:SmartFilterBar>
                    </FlexBox>
                </f:content>
            </f:DynamicPageHeader>
        </f:header>
        <f:content>
            <!-- <FlexBox fitContainer="true"> -->
                <core:Fragment fragmentName="fico.zcosttransfer.fragments.CostTransfer" type="XML"/>
            <!-- </FlexBox> -->
        </f:content>
    </f:DynamicPage>
</mvc:View>
